1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:00,884
Turunkan!

2
00:00:01,320 --> 00:00:03,836
Dia datang cari tabib!

3
00:00:05,879 --> 00:00:07,530
Adikku demam semalaman,

4
00:00:08,716 --> 00:00:10,341
Tabib, tolong dia.

5
00:00:10,407 --> 00:00:13,534
Liuxi? Itu sejam,

6
00:00:13,625 --> 00:00:16,732
aku tak bisa naik kuda.

7
00:00:16,820 --> 00:00:17,656
Tak perlu bisa.

8
00:00:18,020 --> 00:00:18,585
Pegangan.

9
00:00:24,020 --> 00:00:25,188
Mereka mengejar!

10
00:00:25,253 --> 00:00:26,573
Ada prajurit di belakang!

11
00:00:26,643 --> 00:00:28,130
Pe-pelan sedikit!

12
00:00:28,502 --> 00:00:29,148
Tutup mata,

13
00:00:29,202 --> 00:00:30,273
hitung sampai seratus.

14
00:00:32,745 --> 00:00:34,300
Sembilan puluh delapan,

15
00:00:34,379 --> 00:00:36,600
Sembilan puluh sembilan…

16
00:00:36,672 --> 00:00:38,330
Xiaohe, tahan sebentar lagi.

17
00:00:38,393 --> 00:00:38,936
A-Ling?

18
00:00:39,593 --> 00:00:41,023
Mana pasiennya?

19
00:00:41,227 --> 00:00:43,526
Demamnya terlalu lama,

20
00:00:43,595 --> 00:00:45,019
turunkan dulu panasnya.

21
00:00:45,250 --> 00:00:46,958
Minumkan sekaligus.

22
00:00:47,025 --> 00:00:49,401
Pintar, minum biar nggak panas.

23
00:00:49,470 --> 00:00:51,614
Sebelum subuh, kita lihat turun atau tidak.

24
00:00:52,702 --> 00:00:53,475
Aku yang jaga.

25
00:00:58,302 --> 00:01:01,045
A-Ling, poin suka plus dua belas.

26
00:01:01,227 --> 00:01:04,916
Poin suka lima puluh, peti hadiah terbuka.

27
00:01:05,006 --> 00:01:07,705
Didapat: teknik membuat kaca.

28
00:01:08,037 --> 00:01:10,489
Pasir kuarsa, tungku panas…

29
00:01:10,557 --> 00:01:12,912
Simpan dulu saja.

30
00:01:13,003 --> 00:01:13,790
Kak…

31
00:01:14,218 --> 00:01:15,941
Turun!

32
00:01:16,006 --> 00:01:16,778
Nggak panas lagi!

33
00:01:16,827 --> 00:01:17,697
Turun?

34
00:01:18,027 --> 00:01:20,383
Kalau sudah turun, aman.

35
00:01:20,453 --> 00:01:22,296
Hari Kakak jatuh ke air,

36
00:01:22,371 --> 00:01:24,262
aku lihat ada yang dorong.

37
00:01:24,336 --> 00:01:24,913
Siapa?

38
00:01:25,536 --> 00:01:27,965
Topi jerami, tali merah,

39
00:01:28,033 --> 00:01:29,921
mukanya nggak kelihatan.

40
00:01:29,990 --> 00:01:31,264
Tali merah…

41
00:01:31,841 --> 00:01:32,940
Pintu samping rumah Qian.

42
00:01:33,041 --> 00:01:34,500
Xu Yan, di lumbung,

43
00:01:34,616 --> 00:01:36,076
sudah nggak tertahan.

44
00:01:36,143 --> 00:01:36,840
Diao Qi?

45
00:01:41,743 --> 00:01:44,032
Tunggu Sarjana Xu!

46
00:01:44,119 --> 00:01:45,807
Kalau berani, lakukan.

47
00:01:45,941 --> 00:01:47,523
Hentikan!

48
00:01:47,835 --> 00:01:49,243
Aku yang menangkapnya,

49
00:01:49,448 --> 00:01:50,449
bukan hak kalian.

50
00:01:53,463 --> 00:01:55,481
Sarjana Xu dari Liuxi?

51
00:01:55,564 --> 00:01:58,710
Desa minta jawaban darinya.

52
00:01:58,794 --> 00:02:01,400
Biarkan, atau serahkan ke mereka?

53
00:02:03,180 --> 00:02:05,073
Sarjana, kau putuskan.
